cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the accompanying data tables, please cite both the manuscript and this repository."

title: "Ecoli_AFR_Genomic_Surveillance: Comparative genomic analysis of Escherichia coli ST10, ST131, and ST167 in Africa and Jordan"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code, intermediate data tables, and supplementary data for a
  comparative genomic study of 444 high-quality Escherichia coli genomes
  (ST167 n=189; ST131 n=151; ST10 n=104) from 14 African countries and
  Jordan. The pipeline characterises population structure, antimicrobial
  resistance genes and chromosomal mutations, virulence determinants,
  plasmid replicons, capsule (K-) and O-antigen loci, pangenome
  composition, and core-genome phylogeny.
type: software

